  "description": "From a young age, Hae-Min has always been stimulated by pretty things. Back then, it was the luster of a new toy or a classmate’s slender hands. Now, it’s his sunbae’s beautiful face. Now that he’s in college, his gaze is drawn to Young-Won: the most popular and downright gorgeous guy in school. Afraid to approach him, he photographs Young-Won from afar, the pictures he takes feeding his secret fantasies. But when Young-Won finds out, Hae-Min is forced to face the object of his desires. Before he knows it, those secret fantasies start becoming a whole lot more real…\n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
